		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>j&#039;aimerez afficher cette fonction en giga octets size</p><p>SELECT&#160; schemaname,<br />sum(pg_total_relation_size(schemaname||&#039;.&#039;||tablename)) as size<br />&#160; from<br />pg_tables where&#160; schemaname &lt;&gt;&#039;public&#039; <br />group by schemaname<br />Merci</p>]]></content>
